msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_no_bank"
msgid "No bank or bank party found in journal bank account."
msgstr "日记账的银行账户中未找到银行或银行往来单位。"

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_no_bank_account"
msgid ""
"No bank account found in journal, if you want to synchronize statements, you"
" need to set a bank account."
msgstr "日记账未设置银行账户。要同步银行对账单，必须先设置银行账户。"

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_no_country"
msgid ""
"Country not found in bank party, please, make sure the bank party have at "
"least one address with country."
msgstr "银行往来单位未设置国家，请确保其至少有一个包含国家的地址。"

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_no_session"
msgid "Session not found."
msgstr "未找到会话。"

msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_valid_days_out_of_range"
msgid ""
"The Enable Banking Session Valid Days fields must be between 1 and 90 days."
msgstr "Enable Banking 会话有效天数字段必须介于 1 至 90 天之间。"

